{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260916140645aa60a3a3285044b1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now, where does the interprocedural connection happen — the callee's parameter entry? Let me look at how `funcInfo` is used, and how a call node connects to the function's body. Search for where functions get \"invoked\" — maybe there's a dispatch key (dispatch_key.go). Let me look at dispatch_key.go and how the solver links a Call node to the FuncDef body.","signature":"37963a2b97ee482687e4a754"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b2e47c8b-b052-45f8-b9f8-606406eb025a","uuid":"b2b4af0a-db05-4db3-8c63-8590c61c2271","timestamp":"2026-09-16T06:06:49.446Z"}
